FROM __BASE_MODEL__
# Nuru on Qwen3.5 (0.8b to 9b). Thinking and per-request sampling come from profiles.yaml: Qwen3.5
# has no thinking levels, and its best sampling depends on whether it thinks, which a Modelfile
# can't express - Nuru sends those settings with every request, on top of these.

# What Nuru uses the model for (Ollama 0.35.1+ records these; the base model already has them, plus
# vision, which Nuru doesn't use), and the Ollama version Nuru relies on: 0.34.4 made forced formats on
# thinking models reliable. REQUIRES is recorded, not enforced. No draft_num_predict: speculative
# decoding needs MTP tensors this model doesn't have - with it, 6.4 tok/s against 30 (2026-10-04).
CAPABILITY tools
CAPABILITY thinking
REQUIRES 0.34.4

# Qwen's recommended sampling for thinking mode (its general chat preset); profiles.yaml overrides
# it for Nuru's requests.
PARAMETER temperature 1.0
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER min_p 0.0
PARAMETER presence_penalty 1.5
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.0
# Safety net against runaway thinking, as for Granite: high enough not to cut off a normal
# think + tool-call turn.
PARAMETER num_predict 8192

SYSTEM """__SYSTEM_PROMPT__"""
